  "priorExpiration": "1998-05-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 102.01 Terms Used. As used in these rules, the following terms shall have the meanings indicated:\n\n(a) \"Board\" means the New Hampshire board of podiatry created by RSA 315:1;\n\nb) \"Practice of podiatry\" means the diagnosis and treatment of ailments of the human foot and lower leg by any medical, mechanical, electrical, and surgical means available; and\n\n(c) \"Podiatrist\" means a doctor of podiatric medicine holding a license to practice podiatry issued by the board under RSA 315:8.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #7816, eff 1-7-03; ss by #14372, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
